>    local({c<-2; mutate(data.frame(q=1:3),.(q),r=q/c)})
> and the problem is not specific to mutate:
>> local({a<-2; ddply(data.frame(q=1:3),.(q),summarize,r=sum(q)/a)})
> Error in eval(expr, envir, enclos) : object 'a' not found
