Hi:

Here's another option:

m1 <- matrix(runif(20),4,5)
m2 <- m1 + rnorm(20)/10

ddply(merge(melt(m1), melt(m2), by = c('X1', 'X2')), .(X1), summarise,
r = cor(value.x, value.y))

HTH,
Dennis

